    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "okay, that makes me feel a bit better. i'm not really in a position to go to the urgent care right now because of work and stuff. do you think i could just take some ibuprofen to help with the throbbing? and is there any chance this could be something like cellulitis? i read online that cellulitis can get really bad really fast.",
